<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>What if I miss you for the rest of my life? - Live in the Studio</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Janine Berdin</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">What if I miss you for the rest of my life? (Live in the Studio)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5pJ6rSn84USs0Gu79JzKrb</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.190" end="00:12.550">How could I forget your pretty face?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.550" end="00:18.550">When you go to places, do you think of me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.550" end="00:22.250">Please think of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.250" end="00:28.690">A year has passed and I thought I moved on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.690" end="00:33.950">I admit you won, now please come back to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.950" end="00:41.400">Won't you come back to me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.400" end="00:47.800">People come and go sometimes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.800" end="00:55.800">Call me your favorite one last time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.100" end="01:03.860">I'll never get to find no one like you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.860" end="01:09.510">You were all I wanted, you were all I needed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.510" end="01:13.350">Us is all I'll be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.350" end="01:19.650">People come and go sometimes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.650" end="01:25.440">Call me your favorite one last time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.440" end="01:33.440">'Cause I have swallowed all my pride</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.110" end="01:41.440">Accepted the end of you and I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.440" end="01:49.440">But what if I miss you for the rest of my life?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.500" end="02:03.510">Where do I go from here?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.510" end="02:11.510">I, I, I, I, I, I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.120" end="02:32.970">I have built a house where I wait for your return</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.970" end="02:39.420">I only want you to be mine and not a lesson learned</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.420" end="02:46.080">And I will wait and wait and wait until this city burns</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.080" end="02:54.080">I will wait and wait and wait and live on what we were</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.190" end="03:07.190">How could I forget your pretty face?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.670" end="03:16.670">When you go to places, do you think of me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.850" end="03:28.850">Please think of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:41.550" end="03:45.550" /></div></body></tt>